				"string" : "## Evidence and limits\nSuperGame.image / Pharo13.1.0SNAPSHOT. Initial combined run: 55 examples, 52 successes, 1 failure, 2 errors, zero skips. Presentation ID assertion compared Symbol to Bloc ID; corrected example assertion to asBlocElementId. Final focused presentation suite: 4 successes, zero failures/errors/skips. Existing Fairy suite: 39 successes; Codex: 8 successes; window title suite: 2 successes / 2 BrEditorWrongThreadError errors. chatWindowTitleAfterMessage individually rerun and still errors through BrTextStylerAsyncStrategy/BrAsyncElementFuture UI-process assertion. Native title example also errors; these are unresolved, not a green regression claim. No upstream editor fix attempted.\n\nWalkthrough: {{gtMethod:BVCFairyChatElementExamples>>#barryEntryPoint}}. {{gtMethod:BVCFairyChatElementExamples>>#messagePresentations}} constructs/binds both real renderers and lays out a preview. {{gtMethod:BVCFairyChatElementExamples>>#fixedComposerAndDraft}} checks actual sibling hierarchy, draft identity/multiline preservation, and non-overlapping layout at 800x600. History/provider identity is checked by styledConversation. Presentation evidence {{gtObject:id=7pseh1aikdjjfn8bhjmyjwkdz}}; fixed composer {{gtObject:id=bwepsyey5x3szfqagtoqn66yb}}; unresolved title error {{gtObject:id=dkbzkc964ks6bgcn6qkkh35w6}}. These do not prove interactive usability, native window correctness or live provider streaming.\n\nSource manifest: BVCFairyChat>>asElement; BVCFairyChatElement>>initialize, initializeListElement, messageElementClassFor:, updateElement; BVCFairyDeveloperMessageElement>>initialize and class>>newForChatList; BVCFairyReplyMessageElement>>initializeHeaderElement, initializeStyling; BVCFairyChatElementExamples>>styledConversation, barryEntryPoint, fixedComposerAndDraft, messagePresentations. Four new classes; all in BV-Catalyst-Fairy-Core UI/Examples tags. No Foundation/Runtime/Process changes, no Codex ensure-close change, no source save/export/stage/commit/push/sync/build. Prior Foundation partial work remains unverified/preserved.\n\nRecovery repair update: the retained title helper was using the stopped legacy universe. It now dispatches through the active Winit universe with a bounded, cancellation-aware BVCFairyUIRequest. Current presentation examples 4/4 and window-title examples 4/4 pass as part of the 80-example repair run. See [[Catalyst Fairy window titles]] for the recovery path, evidence and limits. Interactive UX features listed below remain unfinished; this update does not claim them complete."
			},
